From 2088eee683364352f78ccedc61395e6aba9fa0b7
Subject: web_worker: let the render worker start ahead of the engine
Origin: https://github.com/robtfm/bevy/commit/2088eee683364352f78ccedc61395e6aba9fa0b7
Date: 2026-09-23T23:30:06+01:00

`start_render` prepares the canvas and spawns the render worker alone;
`start_with_render` spawns the rest later. The render worker's setup
export and device creation run as soon as it is up and it then waits
for the engine's render world, so an app can warm a pipeline cache on
the device while the user is still at its launch screen. `start` is the
two in sequence.
